<section class="comfort-coordinate" id="home-02"><header><p class="eyebrow">02 / COMFORT COORDINATE</p><h2>Four points decide the feel.</h2></header><div class="coordinate-grid"><article><b>X1</b><h3>Toe room</h3><p>Space without folds, pressure or a wandering seam.</p></article><article><b>Y2</b><h3>Arch hold</h3><p>Support that stays present without turning restrictive.</p></article><article><b>X3</b><h3>Heel lock</h3><p>A shaped pocket that follows the foot into the shoe.</p></article><article><b>Y4</b><h3>Climate</h3><p>Moisture movement, insulation and enough air exchange.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="pressure-field" id="home-03"><div class="footprint"><i class="toe"></i><i class="arch"></i><i class="heel"></i><span>PRESSURE<br>FIELD</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / PRESSURE FIELD</p><h2>Cushion where force arrives.</h2><p>More padding everywhere can crowd the shoe. A better system places protection under the heel and forefoot while keeping the arch and upper foot responsive.</p><a href="journal-06.html">Read the cushioning guide →</a></div></section>
<section class="fibre-spectrum" id="home-04"><header><p class="eyebrow">04 / FIBRE SPECTRUM</p><h2>Choose the behaviour, not the buzzword.</h2></header><div class="spectrum"><span style="--p:#3153d8"><b>MERINO</b><small>buffer + warmth</small></span><span style="--p:#6ac4b7"><b>LYOCELL</b><small>smooth + cool</small></span><span style="--p:#ff8b66"><b>NYLON</b><small>strength + recovery</small></span><span style="--p:#7b3d78"><b>ELASTANE</b><small>hold + movement</small></span></div></section>
<section class="lab-aperture" id="home-05"><figure><img src="assets/images/core-lab.svg" alt="Fibre testing bench with yarn and tension tools"><figcaption>LAB APERTURE / TENSION TEST</figcaption></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / TEXTILE LAB</p><h2>Every knit is a set of decisions.</h2><p>Loop density, yarn blend, panel placement and finishing determine whether comfort survives after the first wash and the fifth mile.</p><a class="button dark" href="textile-lab.html">Open the lab notes</a></div></section>
<section class="gait-sequence" id="home-06"><header><p class="eyebrow">06 / GAIT SEQUENCE</p><h2>Comfort changes through one step.</h2></header><ol><li><b>01</b><span>Land</span><p>The heel receives impact.</p></li><li><b>02</b><span>Load</span><p>The arch lengthens and stabilises.</p></li><li><b>03</b><span>Roll</span><p>Pressure moves toward the forefoot.</p></li><li><b>04</b><span>Release</span><p>The toes finish the step.</p></li></ol></section>
<section class="sample-drawers" id="home-07"><div><p class="eyebrow">07 / SAMPLE DRAWERS</p><h2>Six systems for different days.</h2><p>Everyday, merino, performance, lounge, dress and care-focused guidance—indexed by what the sock needs to do.</p><a href="sock-index.html">Open all sample drawers →</a></div><img src="assets/images/core-index.svg" alt="Six sock styles in tactile sample drawers"></section>
<section class="field-notes" id="home-08"><header><p class="eyebrow">08 / FIELD NOTES</p><h2>Comfort lessons worth keeping.</h2></header><div><a href="journal-01.html"><span>01</span><strong>Map sock fit around toe, arch and heel</strong><small>READ ↗</small></a><a href="journal-03.html"><span>03</span><strong>Build a commuter sock system</strong><small>READ ↗</small></a><a href="journal-09.html"><span>09</span><strong>Wash performance socks without losing shape</strong><small>READ ↗</small></a></div></section>
<section class="fusion-call" id="home-09"><span>09 / START THE FIT</span><div><h2>Build comfort from the foot outward.</h2><p>Start with fit, add the right fibre behaviour and let the route decide the rest.</p></div><a class="button light" href="journal.html">Read the journal</a></section></main><footer><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href="textile-lab.html">Textile Lab</a><a href="sock-index.html">Sock Index</a><a href="journal.html">Comfort Journal</a></div><div><h3>Contact</h3><p class="nowrap">181 Mercer Street, New York, NY 10012, United States</p><a class="nowrap" href="tel:+18887775845">+1-888-777-5845</a><a class="nowrap" href="mailto:hello@footfusionpoint.com">hello@footfusionpoint.com</a></div><div><h3>Policies</h3><a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a><a href="terms.html">Terms</a><a href="refund.html">Refund</a><a href="shipping.html">Shipping</a></div></footer><aside class="consent"><p>Optional analytics helps us improve the comfort journal.</p><button data-consent="accept">Allow</button><button data-consent="decline">Decline</button></aside><script src="assets/app.js"></script></body></html>